# Three answers to the input, written apart; a judge picks the best and gives it whole.
name: best_of_n
answer_a: model on input "Answer the request."
answer_b: model on input "Answer the request."
answer_c: model on input "Answer the request."
all: collect on AnswerA, AnswerB, AnswerC n 3
pick: model on All input "Request: {input}\n\nAnswers:\n{All.items}" "Pick the best answer to the request and give it whole, unchanged."
end: first Pick
